sequenceDiagram
    participant I as Span Ingester
    participant W as Trace Workers<br/>(shard by trace_id)
    participant S as Tail Sampler
    participant G as Service Graph

    I->>W: OTLP spans (out of order)
    W->>W: Assemble traces<br/>(buffer partial)
    W->>S: Complete traces
    S->>S: Sample decision:<br/>• All errors (keep)<br/>• P99 latency (keep)<br/>• 1% random (keep)<br/>• Normal (drop)
    S->>G: Sampled traces
    G->>G: Build adjacency<br/>(service→service edges)
